 upgraded roguelite save","startSeconds":1912,"videoId":"oWr0sy0YwGg"}],"title":"New Crew, New Rotation"},{"id":"mid-run-quotas-texas-plan","segments":[{"endSeconds":17993,"label":"The expanded crew clears more quotas, pushes the power curve, and secures the plan for another Texas run","startSeconds":10013,"videoId":"oWr0sy0YwGg"}],"title":"Mid-Run Quotas & Texas Plan"},{"id":"texas-train-run-4","segments":[{"endSeconds":19264,"label":"The crew hits Texas with the silenced pistol and finally works the train cars with a dedicated shooter","startSeconds":17993,"videoId":"oWr0sy0YwGg"}],"title":"Texas Train Station"},{"id":"final-quota-run-4","segments":[{"endSeconds":25916,"label":"After Texas, the remaining crew strips Rural Street and Lakeside to drag the final quota over the line","startSeconds":19264,"videoId":"oWr0sy0YwGg"}],"title":"Final Quota"},{"id":"victory-master-difficulty","segments":[{"endSeconds":26487,"label":"Another victory unlocks Master difficulty and the invisibility tool, followed by a brief post-run look at the stronger save","startSeconds":25916,"videoId":"oWr0sy0YwGg"}],"title":"Victory & Master Difficulty"}],"id":"run-4-victory","people":["SeaNanners","StuStutters","GassyMexican"],"title":"Run 4 - Victory"}],"id":"crime-simulator","image":"https://static-cdn.jtvnw.net/ttv-boxart/623821345_IGDB-210x280.jpg","tags":["Simulation","Co-op","Roguelite","Heist","Crime","Multiplayer","First-Person"],"title":"Crime Simulator"}}
